*   View entry fees (if applicable).\n        *   Submit registration (may require admin approval or direct entry).\n    *   **View Competition Registrations:** See which competitions their children are entered into and for which events.\n    *   **View Competition Results:**\n        *   Searchable/filterable by child, competition, event.\n        *   Display times, places, PBs (Personal Bests).\n\n4.  **Squad Information:**\n    *   **View Child\u0027s Squad:** Clearly display the squad each registered child is assigned to.\n    *   **Squad Details:** (Optional) Information about the squad (e.g., training focus, coach, schedule link).\n\n5.  **Club Calendar:**\n    *   View club events: Training schedules (per squad if possible), competition dates, social events, meetings.\n    *   Filterable by event type or squad.\n    *   Option to sync with personal calendars (e.g., iCal, Google Calendar).\n\n6.  **Club Apparel:**\n    *   **View Apparel Catalog:** Browse items like swimsuits, caps, t-shirts, hoodies.\n        *   Display: Item name, description, images, sizes available, price.\n    *   **Place Orders:** (Could be a simple \"expression of interest\" form initially, or full e-commerce with payment integration later).\n    *   **View Order History:** (If e-commerce is implemented).\n\n7.  **Notifications:**\n    *   In-app or email notifications for:\n        *   New member registration approval/rejection.\n        *   Competition registration confirmation.\n        *   Upcoming competition reminders.\n        *   New results published.\n        *   Important club announcements.\n\n**III. Admin Portal Features**\n\n1.  **Dashboard:**\n    *   **Overview/Statistics:**\n        *   Total registered members.\n        *   Pending member registrations.\n        *   Upcoming competitions.\n        *   Recent activity log.\n        *   Number of members per squad.\n    *   **Quick Links:** To common admin tasks.\n\n2.  **Member Management:**\n    *   **View All Members